{"3601550": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "FMV - Full Motion Voyeur", "steam_appid": 3601550, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the Game:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full Motion Voyeur</strong> is a psychological horror FMV thriller where you investigate assigned targets through surveillance feeds, hidden video streams, and Intel files, then decide who will be devoured by the Demon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover an occult conspiracy, search strange video feeds, discover your targets darkest secrets and hidden passkeys to unlock the footage the ADMIN wants you to see. Learn where your targets are hiding and decide who deserve to be devoured by the flame. Carry out increasingly horrifying punishments as Mona is threatened to keep Claire obedient.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Early on, Claire is heavily controlled by ADMIN’s demands. But the deeper you descend, the more your judgments begin to matter. Feed your targets to the Demon or search for another way before the monster strips you of your humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>GAMEPLAY FEATURES</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Investigate. Judge. Feed the Demon.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601550/extras/9f3897e6f9127033f666511530d3ba81.poster.avif?t=1777201254\" width=960 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601550/extras/9f3897e6f9127033f666511530d3ba81.webm?t=1777201254\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601550/extras/9f3897e6f9127033f666511530d3ba81.mp4?t=1777201254\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>SEARCH THE INTEL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Study files, evidence, and personal information to</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">uncover hidden motives, strange locations and passkeys.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601550/extras/c1f24cc3b58ba3a886ab293582159da7.poster.avif?t=1777201254\" width=960 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601550/extras/c1f24cc3b58ba3a886ab293582159da7.webm?t=1777201254\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601550/extras/c1f24cc3b58ba3a886ab293582159da7.mp4?t=1777201254\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>FIND THE SINNERS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Look through video feeds to</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">find your targets and uncover an occult conspiracy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601550/extras/0bd1f04fe22acab1d55c86aa509a7c8f.avif?t=1777201254\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>FEED THE DEMON</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Investigate targets and use the flame to feed them to the Demon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601550/extras/3e60e7da9e96412171980f81782e34d2.poster.avif?t=1777201254\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601550/extras/3e60e7da9e96412171980f81782e34d2.webm?t=1777201254\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601550/extras/3e60e7da9e96412171980f81782e34d2.mp4?t=1777201254\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>PROTECT MONA</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Mona is the leverage used against Claire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Obey and Mona will feel your embrace again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601550/extras/185f8c349f5b89aa27a919723877b27d.avif?t=1777201254\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601550/extras_big/185f8c349f5b89aa27a919723877b27d.webp?t=1777201254 width=1560 height=580 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>REPLAYABILITY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Multiple playthroughs offer new discoveries, outcomes,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">and moral dilemmas. How far will you go to feed the Demon?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Why Play Full Motion Voyeur?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you’re a fan of narrative-driven games like Her Story and Papers, Please, Full Motion Voyeur offers an thrilling investigative experience with gameplay where your judgement matters. Full Motion Voyeur is perfect for players who love  high stakes gameplay mechanics and complex storytelling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spread the word and Wishlist now!</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the Game